{"id":"memorial_105103","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial105100","label":"Call Logs · Looking for the Giant.txt"},"label":"51003.txt","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_105102","next":"memorial_105104","speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_105103_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_03_description","text":"I followed the handprints."},{"id":"memorial_105103_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_03_description","text":"There were no traces of food or fire along the way."},{"id":"memorial_105103_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_03_description","text":"But the handprints even appeared alongside the Raptures' tracks."},{"id":"memorial_105103_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_03_description","text":"Did the Raptures run into the giant?"},{"id":"memorial_105103_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_03_description","text":"I don't see any Rapture remains or blood from the giant, though."},{"id":"memorial_105103_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_03_description","text":"Maybe they never crossed paths. Or maybe they did, but didn't fight."},{"id":"memorial_105103_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_03_description","text":"Or maybe one side was so overwhelmingly strong that it left nothing behind."},{"id":"memorial_105103_8","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_03_description","text":"Maybe the giant doesn't even bleed."},{"id":"memorial_105103_9","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_03_description","text":"The Nikkes are scared and want to head back."},{"id":"memorial_105103_10","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_03_description","text":"And they actually want to go now, even with such a huge discovery right in front of us..."},{"id":"memorial_105103_11","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_03_description","text":"I'm not giving up."}]}